---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="High Energy Bills | AC Repair Wake Forest NC" description="Rising cooling costs in Wake Forest? Inefficient AC diagnosis and repair.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>High Energy Bills</h1>
      <p>Rising cooling costs in Wake Forest? Inefficient AC diagnosis and repair.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>A sudden jump in electric bills during cooling season often means the AC is working harder than it should. Low refrigerant, dirty coils, failing capacitors, or an oversized/undersized system are frequent culprits.</p>
      <p>We measure performance, identify efficiency losses, and recommend cost-effective repairs or upgrades.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Don't wait in the heat. Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day diagnosis and repair in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and surrounding areas.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>